cal Process\",\n      \"description\": \"Language processing is a complex function of the human brain that involves the interpretation and generation of language.\",\n      \"attributes\": {}\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"neural networks\",\n      \"type\": \"Neural Structure\",\n      \"description\": \"Neural networks are interconnected groups of neurons that process and transmit information in the brain.\",\n      \"attributes\": {}\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"neural pathways\",\n      \"type\": \"Neural Structure\",\n      \"description\": \"Neural pathways are the routes through which neural signals travel in the brain.\",\n      \"attributes\": {}\n    }\n  ],\n  \"relations\": [\n    [\n      \"Language processing\",\n      \"Involves\",\n      \"Wernicke\\\"s area\",\n      \"Wernicke\\\"s area is involved in the comprehension stage of language processing.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Language processing\",\n      \"Involves\",\n      \"Angular gyrus\",\n      \"The angular gyrus is involved in the perception and comprehension stages of language processing.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Language processing\",\n      \"Involves\",\n      \"Arcuate fasciculus\",\n      \"The arcuate fasciculus is involved in the integration of language processing between the Broca\\\"s and Wernicke\\\"s areas.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Language processing\",\n      \"Involves\",\n      \"Broca\\\"s area\",\n      \"Broca\\\"s area is involved in the production stage of language processing.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Language processing\",\n      \"Involves\",\n      \"Premotor cortex\",\n      \"The premotor cortex is involved in the production stage of language processing.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Language processing\",\n      \"Involves\",\n      \"Auditory cortex\",\n      \"The auditory cortex is involved in the perception stage of spoken language processing.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Language processing\",\n      \"Involves\",\n      \"Visual cortex\",\n      \"The visual cortex is involved in the perception stage of written language processing.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Language processing\",\n      \"Supports\",\n      \"Language acquisition\",\n      \"Language processing supports the acquisition of new languages, especially in children due to their brain\\\"s high plasticity.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Language processing\",\n      \"Affects\",\n      \"Communication disorders\",\n      \"Damage to brain regions involved in language processing can lead to communication disorders such as receptive and expressive aphasia.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Language processing\",\n      \"Affects\",\n      \"Neurorehabilitation\",\n      \"Understanding language processing in the brain has important implications for neurorehabilitation, particularly in treating language-related disorders.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"language\",\n      \"Processed In\",\n      \"Wernicke\\\"s area\",\n      \"Wernicke\\\"s area is involved in the comprehension and semantic processing of language.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"language\",\n      \"Processed In\",\n      \"Broca\\\"s area\",\n      \"Broca\\\"s area is involved in the production and grammatical processing of language.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"language\",\n      \"Supported By\",\n      \"angular gyrus\",\n      \"The angular gyrus supports language by integrating visual and auditory information necessary for reading and writing.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"language\",\n      \"Connected By\",\n      \"arcuate fasciculus\",\n      \"The arcuate fasciculus connects the Broca\\\"s and Wernicke\\\"s areas, which are crucial for language processing, allowing them to communicate effectively.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"language\",\n      \"Involves\",\n      \"mental lexicon\",\n      \"Language processing involves the brain retrieving words from the mental lexicon and organizing them into grammatically correct sentences.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"language\",\n      \"Facilitates\",\n      \"communication\",\n      \"Language facilitates communication by enabling the exchange of information and ideas.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"language\",\n      \"Facilitates\",\n      \"cognition\",\n      \"Language is a key aspect of cognition, contributing to mental processes such as thinking, knowing, and remembering.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"language\",\n      \"Has Implications For\",\n      \"language development\",\n      \"Understanding how the brain processes language has important implications for the study of language development.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"language\",\n      \"Has Implications For\",\n      \"communication disorders\",\n      \"Research into language processing in the brain can help in understanding and treating communication disorders.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"language\",\n      \"Has Implications For\",\n      \"neurorehabilitation\",\n      \"Understanding the brain\\\"s processing of language can aid in the development of neurorehabilitation techniques for individuals with language-related neurological issues.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"cognition\",\n      \"Involves\",\n      \"language comprehension\",\n      \"Cognition involves the mental process of language comprehension, which is crucial for effective communication.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"cognition\",\n      \"Involves\",\n      \"language production\",\n      \"Cognition involves the mental process of language production, which is essential for expressing thoughts and ideas.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"cognition\",\n      \"Utilizes\",\n      \"Wernicke\\\"s area\",\n      \"Cognition utilizes the Wernicke\\\"s area for the comprehension of language, which is a key aspect of cognitive function.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"cognition\",\n      \"Utilizes\",\n      \"Broca\\\"s area\",\n      \"Cognition utilizes the Broca\\\"s area for the production of language, which is connected to the Wernicke\\\"s area via the arcuate fasciculus.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"cognition\",\n      \"Utilizes\",\n      \"arcuate fasciculus\",\n      \"Cognition utilizes the arcuate fasciculus to facilitate the communication between Broca\\\"s and Wernicke\\\"s areas, which are crucial for language processing.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"cognition\",\n      \"Utilizes\",\n      \"angular gyrus\",\n      \"Cognition utilizes the angular gyrus for integrating visual and auditory information, which supports the cognitive processes of reading and writing.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"grammatically correct sentences\",\n      \"Generated By\",\n      \"brain\",\n      \"The brain organizes words into grammatically correct sentences during the language production stage.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"grammatically correct sentences\",\n      \"Part Of\",\n      \"language production\",\n      \"The creation of grammatically correct sentences is a part of the language production process.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"grammatically correct sentences\",\n      \"Controlled By\",\n      \"Broca\\\"s area\",\n      \"Broca\\\"s area is involved in the control and organization of words into grammatically correct sentences.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"grammatically correct sentences\",\n      \"Controlled By\",\n      \"premotor cortex\",\n      \"The premotor cortex contributes to the motor commands needed to articulate grammatically correct sentences.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"brain regions\",\n      \"Contribute To\",\n      \"linguistic function\",\n      \"Brain regions contribute to different aspects of linguistic function, such as comprehension and production of language.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"brain regions\",\n      \"Involved In\",\n      \"language processing\",\n      \"Brain regions are involved in the stages of language processing, which is a multifaceted process.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"brain regions\",\n      \"Interact With\",\n      \"neural networks\",\n      \"Brain regions interact with neural networks to facilitate the complex interplay required for language processing.\"\n    